1
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:03,250
It's been a long time, you two.

2
00:00:03,650 --> 00:00:05,950
I'm sure your training produced
good results, right?

3
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:09,850
Do you think we came back
without making progress?

4
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:11,610
It went perfectly!

5
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:14,910
Then show me
those results immediately.

6
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:16,850
Show you...?

7
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:19,080
You will take on a particular man.

8
00:00:19,850 --> 00:00:22,750
I didn't send him on any missions
for the past several days

9
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:24,380
and had him stand by
for this very purpose.

10
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:26,980
Your opponent will be...

11
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:29,850
Come in!

12
00:00:33,150 --> 00:00:34,310
Hello.

13
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:41,250
Shikamaru! Temari!
Look who's here!

14
00:00:43,610 --> 00:00:44,750
Naruto.

15
00:00:44,950 --> 00:00:47,280
Hey! That is you isn't it, Naruto!

16
00:00:48,350 --> 00:00:49,310
Shikamaru!

17
00:00:49,650 --> 00:00:52,050
This is... that little shrimp...?

18
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:54,810
So you're back?

19
00:00:54,850 --> 00:00:56,780
Yeah, I got back this morning.

20
00:00:57,910 --> 00:01:00,380
You don't look
as stupid as before...

21
00:01:00,610 --> 00:01:03,680
I mean, hey, have you changed?

22
00:01:06,610 --> 00:01:08,380
No, he hasn't.

23
00:01:08,410 --> 00:01:09,950
Oh... I thought so.

24
00:01:10,210 --> 00:01:11,780
Sakura.

25
00:01:17,450 --> 00:01:21,480
Then, does this mean
you're my opponent, Shikamaru?

26
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:24,010
Opponent? What do you mean?

27
00:01:24,450 --> 00:01:26,680
I just came to deliver
some documents.

28
00:01:26,710 --> 00:01:29,050
Huh? You're not
my opponent, Shikamaru?

29
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:30,380
Then...?

30
00:01:33,280 --> 00:01:34,350
Who're you again?

31
00:01:34,450 --> 00:01:35,850
You don't remember me?

32
00:01:36,150 --> 00:01:38,780
Naruto, that's not your opponent.

33
00:01:39,910 --> 00:01:40,980
He's out there.

34
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:51,510
You sure got tall... Naruto.

35
00:01:53,810 --> 00:01:54,650
Yo!

36
00:01:56,950 --> 00:01:58,210
Kakashi Sensei!

37
00:03:29,780 --> 00:03:32,880
The Akatsuki Makes Its Move

38
00:03:33,180 --> 00:03:36,410
Sensei, you haven't changed one bit!

39
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:38,710
Oh yeah.

40
00:03:38,750 --> 00:03:43,880
Listen, listen...
I've got a present for you, Sensei.

41
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,510
This is sure a nostalgic sight.

42
00:03:47,780 --> 00:03:48,480
Yes, it is...

43
00:03:48,810 --> 00:03:50,780
What?

44
00:03:51,710 --> 00:03:54,010
You got me... Th-This is...

45
00:03:56,080 --> 00:04:00,280
This is the first new title in
the Make-Out series in three years!

46
00:04:00,310 --> 00:04:01,650
I think it's totally boring,

47
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:03,280
but you like this stuff,
don't you, Sensei?

48
00:04:04,210 --> 00:04:08,510
That idiot... No way could
a kid understand the appeal.

49
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:10,210
And on top of that,

50
00:04:10,250 --> 00:04:12,310
it's a very rare item that hasn't
even been released yet...

51
00:04:17,810 --> 00:04:21,180
All right! That's enough fun
for now, Kakashi.

52
00:04:27,510 --> 00:04:30,180
Don't tell me...
Are you my opponent...?

53
00:04:30,510 --> 00:04:33,550
Hmm, not quite...

54
00:04:37,780 --> 00:04:40,880
Gee, it's been a while
since I saw you too, Sakura.

55
00:04:41,410 --> 00:04:42,980
Yes, it has, Kakashi Sensei.

56
00:04:43,780 --> 00:04:45,450
My opponent will be...

57
00:04:49,110 --> 00:04:52,950
Naruto... and Sakura,
the both of you!

58
00:04:54,950 --> 00:04:57,010
Kakashi Sensei's our opponent...

59
00:04:57,450 --> 00:05:00,350
I want to see what you
can do against Kakashi...

60
00:05:00,580 --> 00:05:04,410
I will determine your status
in the future based on the results.

61
00:05:06,050 --> 00:05:07,310
Status, eh?

62
00:05:07,610 --> 00:05:09,310
Sakura, show me that

63
00:05:09,350 --> 00:05:11,880
you weren't just wasting
your time training under me.

64
00:05:12,550 --> 00:05:13,510
Yes, ma'am!

65
00:05:13,580 --> 00:05:15,550
Then, shall we get right to it?

66
00:05:17,250 --> 00:05:19,550
That's what I'd like to say.

67
00:05:20,050 --> 00:05:22,450
But since you just got back Naruto,
you must be tired.

68
00:05:23,210 --> 00:05:24,380
I'll give you a short rest.

69
00:05:24,910 --> 00:05:27,610
I'm not particularly tired
or anything!

70
00:05:28,650 --> 00:05:30,650
Let's meet up at
the Third Training Grounds later.

71
00:05:31,350 --> 00:05:32,380
See ya.

72
00:05:34,050 --> 00:05:36,580
Why's he in such a hurry?

73
00:05:38,710 --> 00:05:40,880
I have a pretty good idea...

74
00:05:41,280 --> 00:05:42,880
He's going to read his book.

75
00:05:43,010 --> 00:05:43,810
Oh!

76
00:05:43,850 --> 00:05:46,710
With that look he had,
there's no doubt about it.

77
00:05:47,450 --> 00:05:49,180
That's the obvious reaction

78
00:05:49,210 --> 00:05:52,310
after getting an unreleased copy
of one of my books.

79
00:05:55,050 --> 00:05:56,880
That Kakashi Sensei.

80
00:05:56,910 --> 00:05:58,880
Is that stupid book
more important to him

81
00:05:58,910 --> 00:06:01,710
than the results of our training?

82
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:06,610
Well, now we can discuss our strategy
against Kakashi Sensei.

83
00:06:09,450 --> 00:06:12,480
So, are you guys on a date?

84
00:06:13,350 --> 00:06:14,750
It's not like that.

85
00:06:15,250 --> 00:06:17,480
Heh! Cut out the jokes.

86
00:06:17,510 --> 00:06:19,010
Why would I be on
a date with this guy?

87
00:06:19,450 --> 00:06:21,410
It's almost time for
the Chunin Exams.

88
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:24,180
I've just been going back and forth
between the Sand and the Leaf

89
00:06:24,210 --> 00:06:25,980
for meetings concerning the Exams.

90
00:06:26,150 --> 00:06:28,350
And although it's a pain,

91
00:06:28,380 --> 00:06:30,480
I've been put in charge
of the Exams...

92
00:06:31,110 --> 00:06:34,310
I've just been told to act as
a guide for the Sand messenger.

93
00:06:36,010 --> 00:06:37,450
Chunin Exams, huh...?

94
00:06:40,050 --> 00:06:41,680
That sure takes me back...

95
00:06:44,150 --> 00:06:44,910
Oh...

96
00:06:45,310 --> 00:06:47,510
So what're you going to do, Naruto?

97
00:06:47,550 --> 00:06:48,880
About what?

98
00:06:49,080 --> 00:06:51,910
About the Chunin Exams.

99
00:06:52,610 --> 00:06:56,980
You're the only one from our class
who hasn't become a Chunin.

100
00:07:04,080 --> 00:07:05,580
What?

101
00:07:06,180 --> 00:07:08,680
Th-Then, you're also a Chunin, Sakura?

102
00:07:09,110 --> 00:07:10,780
Heh-heh... That's right.

103
00:07:11,210 --> 00:07:15,750
And just for the record,
Kankuro, this person here,

104
00:07:15,780 --> 00:07:19,380
and Neji who's one grade above us
are already Jonin.

105
00:07:19,510 --> 00:07:20,950
Huh?

106
00:07:21,980 --> 00:07:24,080
Then what about Gaara?

107
00:07:37,550 --> 00:07:38,810
Lord Kazekage...

108
00:07:39,050 --> 00:07:40,380
The meeting is about to begin.

109
00:07:46,950 --> 00:07:47,880
Okay.

110
00:07:49,810 --> 00:07:50,850
I see...

111
00:07:51,810 --> 00:07:54,410
So Gaara became the Kazekage, huh...?

112
00:07:58,910 --> 00:07:59,880
That's awesome...

113
00:08:02,080 --> 00:08:04,410
I won't be outdone!

114
00:08:10,850 --> 00:08:13,150
I'll become the Hokage,
no matter what!

115
00:08:13,380 --> 00:08:15,250
Just you wait, Gaara!

116
00:08:19,710 --> 00:08:22,280
I guess...
he has matured a little, after all.

117
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:35,750
What do you think?
Pretty good, huh...?

118
00:08:38,310 --> 00:08:40,810
It is my finest work.

119
00:08:49,410 --> 00:08:53,110
I leave Naruto in your care
as promised...

120
00:08:53,850 --> 00:08:57,950
It'd be nice if he's grown
at least a little.

121
00:08:58,310 --> 00:09:01,110
Heh... You'd think I've slipped up?

122
00:09:01,880 --> 00:09:04,510
You'll get beaten out
if you get careless.

123
00:09:04,810 --> 00:09:06,210
Well, that's encouraging to hear.

124
00:09:08,250 --> 00:09:11,210
And their actions are
gaining momentum.

125
00:09:16,110 --> 00:09:17,580
Over the past several years,

126
00:09:17,610 --> 00:09:19,750
the strength of our village
has stabilized,

127
00:09:19,780 --> 00:09:24,510
and relations with the Hidden Villages
in each allied land have prospered.

128
00:09:25,410 --> 00:09:27,610
In particular,
we have achieved good results

129
00:09:27,650 --> 00:09:30,980
in our development of recruits
with the curriculum incorporating...

130
00:09:31,010 --> 00:09:32,910
the training program
from the Leaf Village.

131
00:09:33,310 --> 00:09:38,010
The Chunin Exams are almost here.
I look forward to the results.

132
00:09:38,350 --> 00:09:41,810
However... at this time,
with the Chunin Exams upon us,

133
00:09:41,850 --> 00:09:43,410
there is a nasty rumor
going around...

134
00:09:43,880 --> 00:09:45,380
What is it, Yura?

135
00:09:46,410 --> 00:09:50,510
Have you heard of the organization
called the "Akatsuki"?

136
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:02,110
I see... So they're finally
making their move.

137
00:10:02,650 --> 00:10:06,350
It's something we were expecting
to a degree, though.

138
00:10:07,950 --> 00:10:09,250
The Akatsuki, huh...?

139
00:10:10,450 --> 00:10:15,950
The Akatsuki is a mysterious organization
composed of a dozen or so Shinobi.

140
00:10:17,180 --> 00:10:20,080
The members of the organization
are vicious S-Rank criminals

141
00:10:20,110 --> 00:10:22,350
all listed in the Bingo Book.

142
00:10:23,110 --> 00:10:25,150
Of those identified...

143
00:10:25,910 --> 00:10:29,680
there is Itachi Uchiha from
the Village Hidden in the Leaves

144
00:10:29,710 --> 00:10:33,410
who drove his own clan
to annihilation in one night.

145
00:10:33,950 --> 00:10:36,050
There is Kisame Hoshigaki

146
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:38,380
who was once a member of
the Seven Ninja Swords Men of the Mist.

147
00:10:38,410 --> 00:10:40,350
He was known as
the phantom of the Mist.

148
00:10:41,010 --> 00:10:42,510
And there is Orochimaru

149
00:10:42,550 --> 00:10:44,810
who once plotted the destruction
of the Leaf...

150
00:10:44,850 --> 00:10:46,980
and assassinated
the previous Kazekage.

151
00:10:47,250 --> 00:10:50,750
It is said he used to be
a member of this organization.

152
00:10:55,180 --> 00:10:58,610
Why have they started taking
such dramatic action?

153
00:10:59,210 --> 00:11:00,380
What's their goal?

154
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:04,610
That's beyond me at this point...
What I do know...

155
00:11:08,650 --> 00:11:12,050
is that they're after
what's inside Naruto.

156
00:11:12,450 --> 00:11:17,210
And... that they've got something evil
in mind.

157
00:11:17,910 --> 00:11:19,780
I passed on this information

158
00:11:19,810 --> 00:11:21,810
to those in charge of security
for each land.

159
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:25,980
I sure hope they tighten up
their security immediately.

160
00:11:34,850 --> 00:11:38,850
I see... I'd heard the rumors...

161
00:11:39,250 --> 00:11:41,210
So the organization in question
is finally taking action...

162
00:11:42,510 --> 00:11:45,650
The source of the information
is Lord Jiraiya,

163
00:11:45,680 --> 00:11:47,210
one of the legendary Sannin.

164
00:11:47,550 --> 00:11:49,110
So prior to the meeting,

165
00:11:49,150 --> 00:11:52,610
I took the liberty of issuing an order
to increase Village security.

166
00:11:53,350 --> 00:11:56,050
Anbu Black Ops masters
have already been stationed

167
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:57,450
at key points around the village.

168
00:11:58,280 --> 00:12:00,650
No matter how powerful
the Shinobi may be,

169
00:12:00,680 --> 00:12:03,150
they will not be able
to infiltrate by force.

170
00:12:04,380 --> 00:12:06,980
I hear the members of the Akatsuki
wear black clothing

171
00:12:07,010 --> 00:12:10,080
in addition to capes with
a red cloud pattern on them.

172
00:12:11,110 --> 00:12:13,110
I ordered security to attack
with full force

173
00:12:13,150 --> 00:12:15,510
should they see someone
fitting that description.

174
00:12:19,150 --> 00:12:21,950
Now then...
the meeting is adjourned.

175
00:12:32,010 --> 00:12:33,780
Well done, Yura.

176
00:12:34,080 --> 00:12:36,210
I never thought you'd take action
so quickly.

177
00:12:37,450 --> 00:12:41,110
I have also served as
a superior for four years.

178
00:12:41,750 --> 00:12:43,180
It is my intention...

179
00:12:43,210 --> 00:12:45,880
to always make decisions
while considering...

180
00:12:47,150 --> 00:12:51,050
what's in the best interest...
of the... village.

181
00:13:02,550 --> 00:13:03,550
What's the matter?

182
00:13:03,780 --> 00:13:06,080
Nothing... It's nothing at all...

183
00:13:06,910 --> 00:13:08,380
I just haven't slept much...

184
00:13:08,910 --> 00:13:11,780
I see... You need to take care
of yourself.

185
00:13:11,980 --> 00:13:13,150
Thank you for your concern.

186
00:13:16,910 --> 00:13:19,880
I see... That's right...

187
00:13:32,780 --> 00:13:35,350
I see. So we have to deal
with this one,

188
00:13:35,380 --> 00:13:37,480
then go after the guy
we sent to Orochimaru, huh?

189
00:13:37,610 --> 00:13:43,010
It seems he turned traitor
and leaked information about us.

190
00:13:44,180 --> 00:13:45,750
It can't be helped.

191
00:13:46,350 --> 00:13:49,910
Even I don't know what happens
after the Jutsu is cast.

192
00:13:50,550 --> 00:13:53,580
More importantly,
will just that bag be enough?

193
00:13:54,110 --> 00:13:57,010
Our opponent will be
using the Jinchuriki.

194
00:13:58,780 --> 00:14:01,350
All of my Jutsu are works of art.

195
00:14:02,850 --> 00:14:05,480
And I made sure to
bring my specialty.

196
00:14:09,310 --> 00:14:12,810
After all, our opponent
is the One-Tailed.

197
00:14:27,610 --> 00:14:29,980
Third Training Grounds

198
00:14:39,280 --> 00:14:41,850
Is Kakashi Sensei
going to make us wait forever?

199
00:14:42,310 --> 00:14:44,380
Well, he's always been like this.

200
00:14:45,310 --> 00:14:48,810
Geez, it'd be nice if he'd show
a little improvement.

201
00:14:51,410 --> 00:14:53,250
Oh, sorry about that.

202
00:14:53,280 --> 00:14:55,880
As it happens, I ran into an old woman
in trouble on my way here and...

203
00:14:55,910 --> 00:14:57,350
- Okay! That's a lie!
- Okay! That's a lie!

204
00:15:04,710 --> 00:15:07,480
This place...
kind of takes me back.

205
00:15:12,880 --> 00:15:14,510
Your task for today is

206
00:15:14,550 --> 00:15:17,810
to take these bells away from me
by this afternoon.

207
00:15:18,350 --> 00:15:20,650
Those unable to get a bell
will get no lunch.

208
00:15:20,680 --> 00:15:21,410
What?

209
00:15:21,450 --> 00:15:23,180
You'll be tied to those posts and

210
00:15:23,210 --> 00:15:26,080
then I'll eat your lunch right
in front of you.

211
00:15:30,950 --> 00:15:32,550
Oh, come to think of it,

212
00:15:32,580 --> 00:15:35,850
this was your first Training Ground,
wasn't it?

213
00:15:37,810 --> 00:15:39,110
Squad Seven...

214
00:15:40,650 --> 00:15:42,210
The Three-Man Squad, huh...?

215
00:15:44,680 --> 00:15:47,950
We had Sasuke with us...
back then, didn't we?

216
00:15:53,110 --> 00:15:54,480
Don't go!

217
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:57,980
If you do, I'll scream...!

218
00:16:02,010 --> 00:16:03,150
Sakura.

219
00:16:08,150 --> 00:16:09,210
Thanks.

220
00:16:17,110 --> 00:16:18,310
Sasuke.

221
00:16:24,080 --> 00:16:25,410
Sasuke!

222
00:16:34,210 --> 00:16:38,210
Yo, goofball.

223
00:16:46,150 --> 00:16:49,310
Sasuke's name is
off limits for these guys...

224
00:16:55,880 --> 00:16:58,710
Well... Let's see how much
you've grown.

225
00:16:59,310 --> 00:17:01,580
You haven't given up
on Sasuke, have you?

226
00:17:01,750 --> 00:17:02,980
Absolutely not!

227
00:17:03,150 --> 00:17:05,950
That's why I continued my training!

228
00:17:08,910 --> 00:17:12,010
The rules are the same
as when we first met.

229
00:17:12,650 --> 00:17:16,080
I don't care how you do it.
Just take a bell away from me.

230
00:17:17,810 --> 00:17:20,080
- If you don't...
- "come at me with the intent to kill,"

231
00:17:20,550 --> 00:17:22,680
"we won't be able to get the bells", right?

232
00:17:24,550 --> 00:17:26,850
You can use Shuriken
if you want.

233
00:17:26,880 --> 00:17:28,550
If you don't come at me
with the intent to kill,

234
00:17:28,580 --> 00:17:30,080
you won't be able to get the bells.

235
00:17:32,950 --> 00:17:34,250
Exactly.

236
00:17:34,850 --> 00:17:36,580
If you don't come at me
with the intent to kill,

237
00:17:36,610 --> 00:17:37,680
you won't be able to get the bells.

238
00:17:37,980 --> 00:17:40,410
You have until sunrise tomorrow.

239
00:17:48,450 --> 00:17:50,480
Now then, shall we begin?

240
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:53,150
You're not going to do it

241
00:17:53,180 --> 00:17:56,410
while reading your book
this time around, Kakashi Sensei?

242
00:17:56,810 --> 00:17:59,810
Or have you already
finished reading?

243
00:18:00,680 --> 00:18:04,550
Nope... I thought I'd save
the fun for later...

244
00:18:04,910 --> 00:18:06,080
Besides...

245
00:18:06,110 --> 00:18:08,750
Well, I kind of get the feeling...

246
00:18:09,110 --> 00:18:10,680
I may have to...

247
00:18:12,780 --> 00:18:15,680
get a bit serious this time around.

248
00:18:32,510 --> 00:18:33,710
What's that...?

249
00:18:37,780 --> 00:18:40,380
Black clothing and
a red cloud pattern.

250
00:18:40,780 --> 00:18:41,850
Don't tell me...

251
00:18:42,380 --> 00:18:43,250
Is that...?

252
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:45,850
Contact Captain Yura immediately!

253
00:18:47,010 --> 00:18:48,050
Captain Yura!

254
00:18:48,080 --> 00:18:50,280
Some guys from the organization
in question have shown up.

255
00:18:50,380 --> 00:18:51,610
I know.

256
00:18:52,680 --> 00:18:55,450
You don't need to worry...
It'll be over soon.

257
00:19:15,410 --> 00:19:17,610
